## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. Set up Python virtual environment (`.venv`) and install dependencies.
2. Execute full pytest test suite:
   ```bash
   .venv/Scripts/pytest tests/ -v
   ```
3. Run code quality checks:
   ```bash
   .venv/Scripts/ruff check .
   ```

### End-to-End Smoke Tests & Manual Verification
1. Run `supplyguard scan .` against SupplyGuard's own codebase:
   ```bash
   .venv/Scripts/python -m supplyguard.cli scan .
   ```
   Verify 0 secrets leaked, clean findings report, and SQLite persistence in `supplyguard.db`.
2. Run `supplyguard scan examples/vulnerable-demo-app`:
   ```bash
   .venv/Scripts/python -m supplyguard.cli scan examples/vulnerable-demo-app
   ```
   Verify detection of all 5 vulnerability categories and calculated risk score.
3. Launch Flask dashboard:
   ```bash
   .venv/Scripts/python -m supplyguard.cli web --port 5000
   ```
   Verify interactive charts, dark mode UI, and filterable findings table.
